    // they are not on by retyping an author list, and this file compares exact
    // strings. All fourteen matched the drafters' citations exactly, which is a
    // reading rather than an assumption — the fetch ran against all fourteen ids
    // in one query and every field was diffed.
    //
    // `reports` read off each abstract, per this module's asymmetric rule, with
    // the sentence that decided it quoted above each row. Note the shape of the
    // set: several are software-package or benchmark papers, where
    // `theory: "absent"` is the honest value and `simulation: "unknown"` is the
